sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as RM/Admin via controller
    participant SG as :SessionGuard
    participant RG as :RolesGuard
    participant Loan as :EquipmentRequestService
    participant DB as :PrismaService
    participant Time as :Clock
    participant History as :HistoryService
    Staff->>SG: canActivate(cookie)
    SG-->>Staff: Principal or 401
    Staff->>RG: authorize(principal,RM_or_Admin)
    RG-->>Staff: Allow or 403
    Note over Staff,Loan: Continue only if guards allow and physical handover confirmed.
    Staff->>Loan: handover(requestId,actor)
    Loan->>DB: $transaction(convertReservationToLoan)
    Note over Loan,DB: Lock the resources row first in READ COMMITTED.<br/>Reload request, reservation, borrower and actor.<br/>Approved and uncollected, correct reservation, borrower active, item In service.<br/>Hidden alone does not prohibit handover.
    Loan->>Time: now()
    Time-->>Loan: serverNow
    Note over Loan,Time: expiry=min(confirmedPickupAt+24h,returnDueAt)<br/>confirmedPickupAt <= now < expiry required
    alt Early, expired, inactive, out of service, stale state or no reservation
        DB-->>Loan: Reject handover with no loan. A due expiry follows ADR-005 Proposed.
        Loan-->>Staff: Deny handover even if stored label is Approved
    else Eligible current handover
        Note over Loan,DB: Inside same tx: record staff/time and convert reservation to loan.<br/>No free occupancy gap, serialize with expiry and pickup editing.
        Loan->>History: append(handoverEvent,tx)
        History-->>Loan: Stored or failure
        alt Persistence/history/commit fails
            DB-->>Loan: Rollback all changes
            Loan-->>Staff: Failure, no partial loan
        else Commit succeeds
            DB-->>Loan: On loan and actual handover time
            Loan-->>Staff: Success and unchanged return deadline
        end
    end
